WEBVTT

00:04:56.872 --> 00:05:00.245
But there's a gap
between where that stands,

00:05:00.269 --> 00:05:02.860
and how I communicate it
with the rest of the world.

00:05:03.416 --> 00:05:06.892
And this can make
basic communication a challenge.

00:05:08.106 --> 00:05:11.365
Not many places would hire me,
due to my lack of social skills,

00:05:11.389 --> 00:05:13.689
which is why I applied to Waffle House.

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:19.300
(Laughter)

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:23.748
Waffle House is an exceptional
24-hour diner --

00:05:23.772 --> 00:05:25.725
(Laughter)

00:05:25.749 --> 00:05:29.003
(Applause)

00:05:29.027 --> 00:05:30.967
thank you --